 bubble/src/Utilities.cxx                      | 40 ++++++++++---------
 cermet/cermet.cxx                             |  2 +-
 cmake/run-and-check.py                        |  4 +-
 ...ialMacroscopicStressPeriodicSimulation.hxx | 12 +++++-
 src/MacroscropicElasticMaterialProperties.cxx |  8 +++-
 ...ialMacroscopicStressPeriodicSimulation.cxx | 17 +++++---
 7 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

